      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Draft 7 - `additionalProperties: false` at all levels - Nullable fields for optional metadata - Enum validation for tool names, statuses, error kinds - Schema version constant: `rig.relay.runtime_tool_invocation.v1`",
      "disclosure": {
